---
import SubpageLayout from '../layouts/SubpageLayout.astro';
import Checklist from '../components/Checklist.astro';
import PhotoCredit from '../components/PhotoCredit.astro';
---
<SubpageLayout
  title="Lake View Park in One Hour"
  description="Lake View Park in one hour: a short lake-view route for tight schedules, with walking amount, suitability and weather adjustments."
  path="/one-hour-visit/"
  faq={[
    { q: 'Can I see Lake View Park in one hour?', a: 'Yes — a relaxed one-hour plan built around the lakefront and a viewpoint works without any paid or possibly closed activity. The timing is an editorial estimate, so adjust to your pace.' },
    { q: 'Is the plan suitable for children or limited mobility?', a: 'It is light and mostly flat along the shore, good for most visitors. For toddlers or restricted mobility, shorten it and use the nearest shaded lawn.' },
    { q: 'Does the one-hour plan need tickets or rides?', a: 'No — it needs only park access (confirm any basic entry on-site) and no paid activity, so a closed ride or boating won’t derail it.' },
    { q: 'What if it rains?', a: 'After rain, keep to firmer ground and avoid the slippery lake edge; the lakeside walk still works as long as you stay on stable paths.' },
  ]}
  breadcrumb={[{ name: 'Home', href: '/' }, { name: 'One-hour visit', href: '/one-hour-visit/' }]}
  image="/images/rawal-lake-islamabad.jpg"
  related={[
    { label: 'Two-hour visit', href: '/two-hour-visit/' },
    { label: 'Rawal Lake views', href: '/rawal-lake-views/' },
    { label: 'Opening hours', href: '/opening-hours/' },
    { label: 'Location & map', href: '/location-map/' },
  ]}
>
  <article class="space-y-8">
    <p class="text-lg leading-8 text-slate-700">Short on time? This is a relaxed one-hour plan built around the lake, with no reliance on paid or possibly closed activities.</p>

    <section>
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-[#143844]">The route</h2>
      <ol class="mt-3 list-decimal space-y-2 pl-5 leading-8">
        <li>Arrive and head straight to the open lakefront.</li>
        <li>Walk a stretch of the lakeside path at an easy pace.</li>
        <li>Pause at a viewpoint for photos and the hills beyond.</li>
        <li>Return the same way and head out — about 60 minutes total.</li>
      </ol>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-[#143844]">Walking and suitability</h2>
      <p class="mt-3 leading-8">The route is light and flat-ish along the shore, so it suits most visitors and families with older children. For toddlers or restricted mobility, shorten it and use the nearest shaded lawn.</p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-[#143844]">Dependencies and weather</h2>
      <p class="mt-3 leading-8">It needs no ticket beyond park access and no paid activity, so a closed ride won’t derail it. After rain, keep to firmer ground and avoid the slippery edge. Treat the timing as an editorial estimate, not a measured track.</p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-[#143844]">Make the short visit count</h2>
      <p class="mt-3 leading-8">With only an hour, focus on the lakefront and a viewpoint rather than activities that need confirmation. The walk needs no ticket beyond park access and no paid ride, so it holds up even if something is closed.</p>
    </section>

    <Checklist title="One-hour day-of checklist" items={[
      'Confirm park access and any basic entry on arrival.',
      'Head straight to the open lakefront — no booking needed.',
      'Wear comfortable shoes; the path can be firm or soft.',
      'After rain, avoid the slippery edge and soft ground.',
    ]} />

    <figure>
      <img src="/images/rawal-lake-islamabad.jpg" width="1280" height="960" alt="Calm Rawal Lake view from Lake View Park, Islamabad" class="h-[360px] w-full rounded-[2rem] object-cover card-shadow" loading="lazy" />
      <figcaption><PhotoCredit photo={2} /></figcaption>
    </figure>
  </article>
</SubpageLayout>
